icBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"store","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"store"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly store: Store<Readonly<AsyncQueuerState<TValue>>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L45","children":[{"type":"text","value":"async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:45"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"deprecated","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deprecated"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queuer.state"},{"type":"text","value":" instead of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queuer.store.state"},{"type":"text","value":" if you want to read reactive state.\nThe state on the store object is not reactive in Angular signals."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"setoptions","text":"setOptions","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":3},{"id":"store","text":"store","level":3},{"id":"deprecated","text":"Deprecated","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L26)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Omit`\\<`AsyncQueuer`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"store\"` \\| `\"options\"` \\| `\"setOptions\"`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### options\n\n```ts\noptions: AsyncQueuerOptions<TValue> & AngularAsyncQueuerOptions<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L30)\n\n***\n\n### setOptions\n\n```ts\nsetOptions: (options) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:32](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L32)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`Partial`\\<[`AngularAsyncQueuerOptions`](AngularAsyncQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### state\n\n```ts\nreadonly state: Signal<Readonly<TSelected>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L40)\n\nReactive state signal that will be updated when the async queuer state changes\n\nUse this instead of `queuer.store.state`\n\n***\n\n### ~~store~~\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Store<Readonly<AsyncQueuerState<TValue>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L45)\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nUse `queuer.state` instead of `queuer.store.state` if you want to read reactive state.\nThe state on the store object is not reactive in Angular signals.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AngularAsyncQueuer\ntitle: AngularAsyncQueuer\n---\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L26)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Omit`\\<`AsyncQueuer`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"store\"` \\| `\"options\"` \\| `\"setOptions\"`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### options\n\n```ts\noptions: AsyncQueuerOptions<TValue> & AngularAsyncQueuerOptions<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L30)\n\n***\n\n### setOptions\n\n```ts\nsetOptions: (options) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:32](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L32)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`Partial`\\<[`AngularAsyncQueuerOptions`](AngularAsyncQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### state\n\n```ts\nreadonly state: Signal<Readonly<TSelected>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L40)\n\nReactive state signal that will be updated when the async queuer state changes\n\nUse this instead of `queuer.store.state`\n\n***\n\n### ~~store~~\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Store<Readonly<AsyncQueuerState<TValue>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuer.ts#L45)\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nUse `queuer.state` instead of `queuer.store.state` if you want to read reactive state.\nThe state on the store object is not reactive in Angular signals.\n"}
